# Incompatible API changes the API diff gate allows, one per line:
#
#   <module dir><TAB><the line apidiff prints>
#
# The module directory is "." for the root. Each block starts with a comment
# naming the PLAN and step that allow its changes. A release's close-out
# removes its entries: once the next tag is the base, apidiff no longer
# prints them, and scripts/go-apicheck.py fails on them as stale
# (docs/decisions/0014-PLAN-api-policy-gates.md Step 4).

# docs/decisions/0020-PLAN-charm-free-cores-glyphs-and-safetext.md Steps 7 and 8:
# termcap's probe as an I/O-free core, its Bubble Tea host in termcaptea
# (0020-MADR D4, A2). Released in v2.0.0, a major version (A4.2).
.	- ./termcap.Caps.Profile: changed from github.com/charmbracelet/colorprofile.Profile to ColorProfile
.	- ./termcap.KeyboardCaps.Enhancements: removed
.	- ./termcap.KeyboardFlags: removed
.	- ./termcap.NewProber: removed
.	- ./termcap.Prober: removed
.	- ./termcap.Reply.Msg: removed
.	- ./termcap.Reply: old is comparable, new is not
.	- ./termcap.ReportSchemaVersion: value changed from 1 to 2

# docs/decisions/0020-PLAN-charm-free-cores-glyphs-and-safetext.md Step 9:
# termsvc's commands move to termsvctea, over Prepare and PrepareCopy
# (0020-MADR D5, A1.2). Released in v2.0.0, a major version (A4.2).
.	- ./termsvc.(*Notifier).Notify: removed
.	- ./termsvc.(*Notifier).NotifyContext: removed
.	- ./termsvc.(*Notifier).Update: removed
.	- ./termsvc.ActivityBeacon: removed
.	- ./termsvc.Copy: removed
.	- ./termsvc.CopyContext: removed
.	- ./termsvc.LinkPolicy.Open: removed
